  book_index: 6
  book_title: The Adventure Journal of Photographer Sun
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 107
  content: This book chronicles the adventures of a photographer around the world.
  clue_content: "In one story, Sun writes:\n\u201COf all the eastern mountains, The
    Suncradle Mountain is my favorite. A cliff juts out from its slopes, and when
    you watch the sunset from there, the sun seems close enough to touch. It\u2019s
    the most beautiful sunset I\u2019ve ever seen.\n\u201CMany local painters come
    here to sketch. Once, I saw a reporter interviewing a woman painter. She looked
    so happy. She must have loved the place too.\u201D"
